---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout>
    <main class="mx-auto w-full flex-1 max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
        <a
            href="/"
            class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground no-underline transition-colors"
        >
            Back Home
        </a>

        <header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8">
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-headings">
                Terms of Service
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Effective Date: October 19, 2026
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    1. Agreement to Terms
                </h2>
                <p>
                    By downloading the Audexis application, accessing the
                    Audexis website, or subscribing to Audexis Cloud services,
                    you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do
                    not agree to these terms, you may not use the software or
                    hosted services.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    2. Description of Service & Infrastructure Role
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Audexis provides a high-performance desktop audio player and
                    an optional hosted cloud synchronization service ("Audexis
                    Cloud").
                    <strong>
                        Audexis is an infrastructure and playback tool, not a
                        content provider or music distributor.
                    </strong>
                    We do not sell, license, catalog, or distribute music or
                    audio recordings. You are exclusively responsible for
                    obtaining and managing the audio files you upload, store,
                    and stream through the platform.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    3. User Content & Copyright Compliance
                </h2>
                <p class="mb-3">
                    You retain 100% intellectual property ownership of any audio
                    files, metadata, or artwork you upload to Audexis Cloud. By
                    uploading files, you represent and warrant that:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        You own the legal rights to the audio content or have
                        obtained explicit permission or legal fair-use
                        authorization to store and stream the content privately.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Your storage and streaming of the content are strictly
                        for personal, private, non-commercial use.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        You will not use Audexis Cloud to publicly distribute,
                        broadcast, sell, or facilitate copyright infringement.
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    Audexis reserves the right to terminate accounts and delete
                    stored files associated with repeat copyright infringement
                    or abuse of service.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    4. Subscriptions, Billing & Cancellations
                </h2>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Billing Cycle:</strong> Audexis Cloud Standard
                        is billed on a recurring monthly subscription basis
                        ($4.99/month) processed through Stripe. Subscriptions
                        automatically renew unless cancelled prior to the
                        renewal date.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Cancellations:</strong> You may cancel your
                        subscription at any time via the Stripe Customer Portal
                        accessible from your Audexis Dashboard. Upon
                        cancellation, your account will remain active with full
                        access until the end of your current paid billing
                        period.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Storage Quotas:</strong> Audexis Cloud Standard
                        includes up to 100 GB of personal audio file storage. We
                        reserve the right to prevent additional uploads if your
                        library exceeds your tier's allocation.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Refunds:</strong> Because the Audexis client
                        software is free to test and evaluate locally, cloud
                        hosting subscriptions are generally non-refundable
                        except where required by applicable consumer law.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    5. Disclaimer of Warranties
                </h2>
                <p>
                    The Audexis client software and hosted services are provided
                    on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of
                    any kind, whether express or implied. While we employ secure
                    and redundant cloud infrastructure,{" "}
                    <strong>
                        Audexis is not an archival cold-storage backup service
                    </strong>
                    . You are solely responsible for maintaining local copies
                    and backups of your personal audio files.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    6. Limitation of Liability
                </h2>
                <p>
                    To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Audexis
                    and its maintainers shall not be liable for any indirect,
                    incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages,
                    including loss of data, audio files, or profits arising out
                    of your use of the software or cloud service.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    7. Modifications to Terms
                </h2>
                <p>
                    We reserve the right to revise these terms to reflect
                    infrastructure updates, legal requirements, or new features.
                    Material changes will be noted by updating the "Effective
                    Date" at the top of this document.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
